 mpa.govagendas (https:tampa.govagendas) The public and citizens of the Cit
 y of Tampa will be able to watch\, listen or view this meeting on: Cable T
 V: Spectrum Channel 640 Frontier Channel 15 Internet: https:www.tampa.govl
 ivestream (https:www.tampa.govlivestream) Members of the public can either
  attend the meeting in person in City Council Chambers located on the 3 rd
