 tps:tampa.govADARequest (https:tampa.govADARequest). Should any person des
 ire to appeal any decision of the City of Tampa Community Redevelopment Ag
 ency with respect to any matter to be considered at this meeting\, that pe
 rson shall ensure that a verbatim record of the proceeding is made includi
